  "details": "[Build: 1861 beta or stable branch]\n\nI play VRChat on Windows via Steam and when I use selfie expression, it does something to the game, which when i reload after using the feature, freezes and doesn't respond, so I have to close the game once before it allows me to play again\n\n1. Load VR Chat. (Stable or Beta Build)\n\n2. Turn on selfie expression and use it for a while.\n\n3. Close the game and open it again via Steam after waiting for a little while. (cold boot)\n\n4. You will load into the blank menu section before loading into a world. (aka it has the stylized background)\n\n5. The game will be stuck on the blank menu screen and pop up a nonresponsive application menu. (windows thing)\n\n6. At this point for me to play again, I have to quit the game and open it again to play.\n\nThe Output logs are from when the game failed to load the past 2 times",
